                                         "sendBody":  true,
                                         "specifyBody":  "json",
                                         "jsonBody":  "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: \u0027perplexity/sonar\u0027, temperature: 0, max_tokens: 900, usage: { include: true }, messages: [ { role: \u0027system\u0027, content: \u0027You are a careful research assistant for social media posts. Only state facts that are explicitly written in a source you cite. Never invent numbers, studies, quotes or sources. Answer in German.\u0027 }, { role: \u0027user\u0027, content: \u0027Research this topic: \"\u0027 + $json.thema + \u0027\".\u0027 + ($json.fragen ? \u0027 Answer these questions: \u0027 + $json.fragen + \u0027.\u0027 : \u0027\u0027) + \u0027 Return 3 to 5 key facts, each on its own line in the form \"- \u003cfact\u003e (Quelle: \u003cfull URL\u003e, \u003cpublication date if known\u003e)\". Prefer sources from the last 12 months and primary sources. Leave out any fact without a reliable source. If there is no reliable source at all, answer only with the line KEINE_BELEGE.\u0027 } ] }) }}",
